From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yeoreum Yun <yeoreum.yun@arm.com>
Date: Fri, 8 May 2026 18:54:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "firmware: arm_ffa: Change initcall level of
 ffa_init() to rootfs_initcall"

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2166208

This reverts commit 0e0546eabcd6c19765a8dbf5b5db3723e7b0ea75, which was
added to address ordering issues with the IMA LSM initialisation where
the TPM would not be fully ready by the time IMA wanted it. This has
been resolved within IMA by retrying setup during late_initcall_sync if
the TPM is not available at first.

Signed-off-by: Yeoreum Yun <yeoreum.yun@arm.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260508-b4-ffa_plat_dev-v1-1-c5a30f8cf7b8@kernel.org
Signed-off-by: Sudeep Holla <sudeep.holla@kernel.org>
(cherry picked from commit cc7e8f21b9f0c229d68cf19a837cba82b5ac2d87)
Signed-off-by: Carol L Soto <csoto@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Jamie Nguyen <jamien@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Nirmoy Das <nirmoyd@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Matthew R. Ochs <mochs@nvidia.com>
Signed-off-by: Brad Figg <bfigg@nvidia.com>
Ledger-Change: C-01946
Ledger-Origin: nvidia-bos@0f2646355cd94ae9be577aff8b9c7a10dd39483a
---
 drivers/firmware/arm_ffa/driver.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/arm_ffa/driver.c b/drivers/firmware/arm_ffa/driver.c
index 80b3dcd92b92..fc8cfcc1492e 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/arm_ffa/driver.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/arm_ffa/driver.c
@@ -2188,7 +2188,7 @@ static int __init ffa_init(void)
 	kfree(drv_info);
 	return ret;
 }
-rootfs_initcall(ffa_init);
+module_init(ffa_init);
 
 static void __exit ffa_exit(void)
 {
